    THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "If a company fails to provide the information required under subsection (1) or (2), an offence is committed by"
    ELSE `s 113(7)(a)-(b) the person is the company or an officer of the company who is in default` person `s 1121 the officer is in default`

-- src:1607 | (4) A person guilty of an offence under this section is liable on summary conviction to a fine not exceeding level 3 on the standard scale.
