GIVETH A Penalty
`s 120(4) the penalty for an offence under s 120` MEANS
    Penalty OF `on summary conviction`, NOTHING, JUST (`a fine not exceeding a level on the standard scale` 3 1), NOTHING, FALSE -- no daily default fine in this subsection

-- ---- s 120A: protected material (a power to make regulations, one definition, one limit) --------------------------------------------
