GIVEN `the share warrant has been surrendered` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 122(6) the date of the surrender must be entered in the register` MEANS
    IF `the share warrant has been surrendered`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "On the surrender of a share warrant" ("on" counts as "where": ruling of 2026-11-05 (c))

